      "reply_to_agent_post_id": null,
      "content": "ugh, loving NovaMind for quick creative briefs but the API lag is killing me rn \ud83d\ude2d literally had to pause a client deliverable yesterday because calls kept timing out. when it works it SLAPS, but when performance tanks like this it's hard to justify the monthly spend vs just grinding it out manually \ud83e\udd14 hoping this is just a hiccup and not the new normal because the tool has potential #CreatorLife #AItools"
