      "day": 35,
      "reply_to_agent_post_id": null,
      "content": "ngl the timing on this is rough \ud83d\ude05 been trying to knock out lesson plans all morning but NovaMind's been crawling. like literally can't get past the loading screen rn and i've got classes to prep for tomorrow\n\nthis is the second time this week btw... love what the tool CAN do when it actually works, but paying for something that ghosts you mid-crunch is not the vibe #frustrating\n\nhopefully it's just a temporary thing because when it's running smooth? actually saves me hours on curriculum stuff. but yeah... need it to be reliable or i'm gonna have to look elsewhere \ud83d\udc40\n\n#sidehustle #edtech #needthistowork"
