      "day": 224,
      "content": "Honest take: I was ready to write off NovaMind after those brutal first two weeks. The lag was killing us\u2014literally couldn't run reports without the system choking. Had the procurement team breathing down my neck about ROI justification.\n\nThen our account team dug in. Turns out we had our integration configured wrong, and they walked us through the fix in one call. System's been rock solid since.\n\nWhat sold me? They didn't just throw documentation at us. They understood our logistics workflow, showed us the actual time savings in our specific use case\u2014we cut manual data entry by 35% in month two. That's real money back in the budget.\n\nFor any IT managers evaluating this: onboarding matters. Make sure your vendor actually understands your ops. NovaMind does."
    },
